1️⃣1️⃣ Common Interview Questions
What is Service Discovery?

A mechanism that allows microservices to dynamically locate and communicate with each other without hardcoding hostnames and ports.

Types of Service Discovery

Client-side discovery (Eureka)

Server-side discovery (Kubernetes)

What happens if Eureka Server goes down?

Clients use cached registry for some time.

